+/*
+ * The Lua opcodes Grim Mouse's scripts (mouse.lua and the patched game
+ * scripts in grim-mouse.lab) call. Originally by Tobias Pfaff for ResidualVM
+ * (2014, GPL-2.0-or-later); ported to ScummVM for PointyClicky. Without
+ * grim_mouse=true there is no hotspot manager and they do nothing (the
+ * stock scripts never call them).
+ */
